# This repo contains ONE thing: the Kuzzle API key dispenser in .github/
# Everything below is local FiveM/txAdmin state that must never be committed.

# --- bulk server state -------------------------------------------------------
# server-data/ is ~17 GB across ~82k files (cached assets, logs, player state).
server-data/

# --- txAdmin profile ---------------------------------------------------------
# admins.json holds txAdmin password hashes.
# playersDB.json / cachedData.json hold player Steam identifiers.
# logs/ hold full server output.
txData/

# --- FXServer binaries and bundled txAdmin -----------------------------------
enhanced/

# --- agent workspace metadata ------------------------------------------------
.freebuff/

# --- secrets, belt and braces ------------------------------------------------
# The admin Kuzzle key lives in GitHub Secrets, never in this repo.
# sv_pre.cfg (in the TMC.TEST profile, not here) also carries one in plaintext.
*.cfg
*.env
key.json
*.key

# --- OS / editor noise --------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store